~ start
Fenn: By Post... you're Az Featherstone, right?
Az: Yeah- wait what?
Fenn: Great blacksmith apprentice and daughter to the incredible Knight of Craft, Abdullah Featherstone of Kuva?
Az: Kid, I'm busy right now. I saw one of the wizards run into the cellar
Fenn: Whoa, really?! We've gotta go get him!
Az: Absolutely not, kid. There's no we. You stay here. I'll handle this.
Fenn: Wait can you breathe fire? You totally can, right? I mean, you're Dad can, so you probably can too. That's so cool. I wish I could breathe fire.
Az: I- no. Kid, stop. Stay here, where it's safe. I'll be back later. I can, like, sign autographs or something if you want.
Fenn: Aw...
Az: Az runs off
=> END